  "tagline": "4 bedrooms, sleeps 9",
  "summary": "Why choose between being together and having privacy? The Compound gives you the best of both worlds with the spacious 3-Bedroom Main House plus the attached, fully modern Private Studio. Perfect for large groups, in-laws, or teams who want a shared headquarters with a separate escape pod for quiet moments. Unbeatable location steps from Hayward Field.",
  "sections": [
    {
      "title": "The space",
      "text": "Total versatility with 4 Bedrooms total, 2 Kitchens, and 2 Full Bathrooms. The 4th bedroom is actually a completely separate studio with its own entrance, deck, and heated floors perfectly suited for grandparents or the couple who wants extra privacy. The Main House is a social hub with a large retro kitchen and living area for the whole group to gather.\n\nEnjoy access to multiple outdoor areas including the studio private deck and the shared fenced yards. You literally cannot be closer to the action of UO and Hayward Field without being on the track itself."
    },
    {
      "title": "Guest access",
      "text": "Enjoy access to the entire 2 properties, laundry, yard, spare room :)"
    }
